    content: - [x] Diagnose why `iwe find --meta depends=foo` misses bare frontmatter documents
  - [x] Reproduce via regression test for bare frontmatter `depends: [foo]`
  - [x] Locate parsing path: `MarkdownReader::document` wraps bare frontmatter, then `DocumentFinder::metadata_matches` parses stored YAML
